\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Selective decoding. Risk (logical error rate on committed shots) versus coverage (fraction of syndromes decoded) for the fused and matching decoders, obtained by sweeping the abstention threshold (full coverage on the left). Risk falls monotonically as coverage shrinks: abstaining on low-confidence syndromes trades coverage for reliability. Generated from the run artifact.}}{5}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
